WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:11.220
The history of gaming extends 5,000 years into the past to ancient Egypt.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.720
Ancient games foretold the futures of men and kings.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.200
They were magic ceremonies that determined a person's fate.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.340
These ceremonies were known as the "Shadow Games."

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.990
In the present, a young boy solves the Millennium Puzzle.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.210
He becomes the heir to the Shadow Games.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:38.300
This boy possesses two hearts - one of light and one of darkness.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:42.210
He is known as "Yu-Gi-Oh."

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:50.340
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.250
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.000
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.700
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.800
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.170
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:26.100
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.350
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:39.620
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:46.360
What is truly precious?

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.690
Bakura.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.970
That's...

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:05.650
This is a Shadow Game!

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.450
This was too easy.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:29.290
The Millennium Puzzle is mine.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.130
What?

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.640
I'll face you in this Shadow Game.

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:44.640
Morphing Jar's Trap!
Flame Swordsman in Danger

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:54.750
Bakura, I didn't know you were a Shadow Game duelist.

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.920
Bakura?  I'm not Bakura.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.090
What do you want?

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:04.450
You should know, Yugi.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:10.370
Whoever collects all the Millennium Items will have the power to rule the world.

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:17.280
If you win, I'll return everyone's souls.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.910
But if I win, I get your Millennium Puzzle.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:21.980
That won't happen!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:23.490
Duel!

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:33.030
I play Cyber Commander in defense position.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.100
Honda?

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:43.070
What's going on?  What happened to me?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.360
Yugi!

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:50.130
Everyone's souls are inside their favorite cards?

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.920
You're realizing this too late.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:56.480
It's my turn.  I play this card.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.770
White Magical Hat.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.410
Attack!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.890
What's going on?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.490
Honda!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:20.000
Destroyed cards are sent to the graveyard, along with the souls that are trapped inside.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:20.970
What?

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.240
The Reaper will soon arrive at the graveyard.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:30.240
If the Reaper takes Cyber Commander away, Honda's physical body will die.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.850
Honda will die?

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.490
Honda!

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.610
Where am I?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.970
What's going on?

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.180
You finally understand.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.450
But a Shadow Game cannot be stopped!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.770
It's your turn.  What will you do, Yugi?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.130
Honda, I promise to save you from the graveyard.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:20.400
I can't carelessly play the cards that have my friends' souls inside.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:26.610
But the only card that can defeat White Magical Hat is Jonouchi's Flame Swordsman.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.090
This is my next card!

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.450
Flame Swordsman.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.320
Huh?  What?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.620
Jonouchi!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.550
Is that you, Yugi?

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.990
What's going on?

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.850
Stay calm and listen.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:51.440
Your soul is trapped inside that card, so you've become Flame Swordsman.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:52.840
What?

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:55.640
If I don't win this duel, you can't return back to normal.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:06:00.810
And if you lose in battle, you'll be sent to the graveyard, just like Honda.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.520
The graveyard?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:09.480
But I need your help to end this dangerous duel and return everyone to their bodies.

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:12.000
Leave it to me.  Don't worry.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.120
Jonouchi?

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:15.320
This is just a dream anyway.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:16.720
I'll finish this quick!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:18.520
Who's my opponent?

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.930
Bakura?

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.480
Bakura is our opponent?

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.280
What a crazy dream.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.040
That's not Bakura.

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:32.260
That's a shadow duelist that took over Bakura's body.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:35.250
I don't what's going on, but I'll beat him.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:46.010
I did it, Yugi.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.970
It's your turn!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.890
I play this.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.930
What's that card?

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.170
It doesn't matter.  He's scared!

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:05.040
Wait, Jonouchi!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.730
Here I go!

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:15.650
I did it.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:16.880
You fell for it.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.550
Morphing Jar.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:20.990
Did I mess up?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:25.730
When Morphing Jar is flipped faceup, all cards in our hands are sent to our graveyards.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:30.900
Luckily, I don't have anyone's soul card in my hand right now.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.200
I'm sorry.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.330
Dark Magician!

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:47.810
Dark Magician is Yugi's soul card.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.530
It's my turn.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:55.090
Furthermore...

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:59.360
That ends my turn.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.120
He set another card.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:05.210
Keeping Yugi's soul card in my hand is dangerous.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:16.780
Next, I use the spell card Monster Reborn to resurrect Honda.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.440
Jonouchi and Yugi!  You too?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.240
What's going on?

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:32.930
We've turned into Duel Monsters monster cards.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.200
I don't understand why.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.320
But Yugi, aren't you over there?

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.900
Well...

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.030
Yugi.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.640
This is no time for keeping secrets.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:47.250
We all have to fight together.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:53.730
That's the Yugi whose soul is inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.770
It's my other self.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.160
I'm sorry I never told you.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:02.190
I wasn't trying to trick you.

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:04.280
Don't worry about it.  You're still Yugi.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.920
We're still friends.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:06.630
Right.

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.210
You guys...

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.480
Where's Anzu?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.440
She's still inside the deck.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.280
Let's finish this before Anzu is played.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.240
Yeah.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.000
Okay!  Let's finish this fast!

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.140
Hold on.  I'm up this turn.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:23.850
Black Magic!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.970
Morphing Jar!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:35.570
We have to replace our hands again.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.760
I'm sorry.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.930
That was the same card as last time.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.700
This is Anzu's soul card.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.170
Did you draw a good card?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:53.490
You can have up to three copies of the same card in your deck.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:57.060
He still might have one more Morphing Jar.

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:58.770
It's my turn.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.980
I set one card.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.920
Is that Morphing Jar?

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:10.790
However, I activate Just Desserts.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.990
What?

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:29.610
Your life points take 500 points of damage for every monster on your field.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.990
Are you okay, Yugi?

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:36.490
Yeah.  But if I take one more hit, I'll lose.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:52.810
If I lose, everyone will die.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:11:01.290
He might play another Morphing Jar, so it's too dangerous to keep Anzu's soul card in my hand.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.320
Hi, everybody!

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.380
Oh no.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.420
Shh.  Be quiet.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.130
Why are you all cosplaying?

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.590
I'm cosplaying too?

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:24.400
Shh!  Keep your voice down or Bakura will notice!

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.840
What do you mean?

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:29.530
We're currently in the world of Duel Monsters.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:35.130
A Shadow Game duelist is controlling Bakura.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.200
Yugi?

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:39.600
There are two Yugis?

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.680
That's my other self.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:47.210
I don't quite understand, but it seems there's a cool Yugi and a regular Yugi.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.440
You don't have to say it like that!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.090
Sorry.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.360
I'll show you that I can be cool too!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.840
Hey Yugi.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.230
I'll destroy that hidden enemy.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.930
I attack!

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:05.970
Wait, Yugi!

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:07.690
Black Magic!

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.480
You did it!

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.610
Wow, Yugi!

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:20.190
Yugi!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.680
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:24.530
My body's numb.

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:25.620
Pull yourself together!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.130
Yugi...

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:36.570
If a non-Zombie Type monster attacks Electric Lizard, it can't attack next turn.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.250
I end my turn.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:50.410
You can't hide her.  I know it's Anzu.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.490
I'll teach you a lesson.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:59.650
This is Man-Eater Bug.

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.530
Yugi, what does that card do?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:11.050
When that card flips faceup, it destroys one monster on the field.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.940
One of us will be destroyed?

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:17.140
I don't want to go back to the graveyard.

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:20.080
But it's not that powerful.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.840
Let's destroy it next turn.

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:23.350
You can't.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.290
If we attack it, that card will flip faceup.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.950
I see.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:32.810
Yugi, is there a way to stop it from being summoned?

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:38.000
We can if we use our trap card Horn of Heaven.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.830
Phew, you have a trap ready.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:44.670
But one of us has to be sacrificed to activate it.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.210
We can't do that.

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.640
Fine.  I'll go.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.240
You can't, Honda.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:58.050
If Man-Eater Bug activates, one of us will be destroyed anyway.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.610
What's the big idea?

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:08.400
You just returned from the graveyard.  I'll face you!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.890
Jonouchi!

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.090
Prepare to meet your doom!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:25.330
The other Yugi, now's your chance!  Use me!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:30.650
Please!  I don't want my friends to be sacrificed!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:38.960
I activate the trap card Horn of Heaven.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:48.330
By tributing one of my monsters, your monster isn't summoned, and it's destroyed.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.770
Jonouchi!

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:58.050
The rest is up to you, Yugi!

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.290
Damn...

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.090
He's a big show-off!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:11.040
Sooner or later, you're all heading to the same place anyway.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:13.850
It's your turn.

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.330
Where am I?

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.690
What's that?

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:37.550
Jonouchi sacrificed himself for us.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:44.090
I refuse to die!

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.730
Jonouchi...

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.080
Anzu is glowing!

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:16.090
When Magician of Faith is flipped faceup, I can add one spell card in my graveyard to my hand.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.930
The spell card is...

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.530
Monster Reborn!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.730
Jonouchi!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.750
You guys.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.650
You should all have been buried in the graveyard by now.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:46.510
Their friendship creates miracles.

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:48.170
Always.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.880
Friendship?  Don't make me laugh.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:56.130
I'll show you that your buddy-buddy games can't last forever.

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:04.810
This is...

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:09.120
That's Bakura's favorite card.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.440
Change of Heart.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:11.440
That's right.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:17.680
With this card's power, I can make Dark Magician Yugi do whatever I want.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:18.820
What?

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:21.410
Friend will fight friend.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.080
Your evil has no limits!

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.660
Say whatever you want.

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:34.120
Your friendship is over.

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.050
You will die in despair!

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:43.610
Yugi!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.320
Bakura!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:54.490
Bakura's soul was also sealed inside a card.

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.960
Yugi, now's your chance.  Attack me.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.200
What?

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:10.300
Attack me and defeat the shadow duelist.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:14.240
But if I do that, your soul will be...

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:19.060
I don't care.  It's better than being controlled by an evil spirit.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:19.680
Do it.

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.650
How dare you!

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.300
No way!

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.920
It's my turn.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:47.470
Dark Magician Yugi, attack Lady of Faith.

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.970
Understood.  Black Magic!

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:05.830
Damn!  I was so close!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.730
Are you okay, Bakura?

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:20.210
Yes.  Thank you.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.480
Why do you have the Millennium Ring?

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:28.800
My father is an archaeologist and travels around the world.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:35.250
When he went to Egypt, he bought me this Millennium Ring and a card as souvenirs.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:44.410
The man who sold the Ring and the card to my father was from the Shadow Realm.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.640
I feel like I've had the longest dream.

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:55.970
Yeah.  With a scary dark version of Bakura.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.520
Oh, it's nothing.

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.730
Don't scare us.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:12.680
Come to think of it, weren't there also two Yugis?

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:14.890
Was it really just a dream?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.840
That sounded like...

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.000
Let's go!

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:38.120
We ran towards the scream and found Mai Kujaku who lost all her Star Chips.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:43.240
To get back her Star Chips, Yugi challenges the Shadow Player Killer to a duel.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:47.200
Make up for the rest by wagering your life?  Don't do it, Yugi!

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:51.720
How can you battle enemies you can't see that attack from the dark?

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:55.840
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Pitch Black Duel!
Castle of Dark Illusions

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.810
Duel, standby!

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:09.820
The flask glistens

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:17.670
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:26.650
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:34.420
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:40.240
Shower of happiness

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:44.370
I will shower you with it

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:52.640
I will support your lonely back

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:56.880
Shower of happiness

00:21:57.140 --> 00:22:01.000
You are not alone

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:07.720
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
